        <item>
            <title>3.25.3</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:05:19 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>230</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.25.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- The branch shown in the pane header, sidebar and status bar now follows a session into a worktree it entered mid-session (EnterWorktree), instead of showing the branch of the checkout it started in. It also stays correct after the agent changes into a subdirectory, including in jj repositories.
- Moving a session to another folder is now refused while the session is inside a worktree it entered mid-session, and is no longer refused once that worktree has been removed.
]]></description>
